### Create a trip (id is a client-generated UUID)
POST {{host}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{tripId}}",
  "title": "Bali 4 hari",
  "destination": "Bali",
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-23",
  "baseCurrency": "IDR",
  "budgetMinor": 5000000
}

### List my trips
GET {{host}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trip detail + summary
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update (full replacement; activities on removed days become unscheduled)
PUT {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bali 4 hari",
  "destination": "Bali",
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-23",
  "baseCurrency": "IDR",
  "budgetMinor": 5000000
}

### Delete (soft)
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The trip's Seleramu ("Cari tempat" opens prefilled). Any member. taste = null when nothing is saved yet
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/taste
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save the whole Seleramu (OWNER, EDITOR). 422 extraInterests TOO_MANY (> 5) / TOO_LONG (> 40), notes TOO_LONG (> 500)
PUT {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/taste
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "interests": ["FOOD", "NATURE"], "extraInterests": ["Sakura"], "style": "SANTAI", "priceLevel": "MEDIUM", "notes": "tanpa babi" }
